tps://api.github.com/users/hpvb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nDoes not reproduce in v4.7.beta1, but does occur in beta2 and later versions.\n\n### Reproduced\n- v4.7.stable.official.5b4e0cb0f\n- v4.7.beta3.official.860821708\n- **v4.7.beta2.official.777579205**\n\n### Not reproduced\n- **v4.7.beta1.official.1c8cc9e7e**\n- v4.7.dev4.official.755fa449c\n- v4.6.3.stable.official.7d41c59c4\n- v4.6.2.stable.official.71f334935\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Direct3D 12 (Mobile) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce MX550 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9608) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-1270P (16 threads) - 31.24 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nOn an actual Pixel 8 Pro device, `ResourceLoader.load_threaded_request()` for a `PackedScene`　**intermittently fails to complete**.\n`ResourceLoader.load_threaded_get_status()` kept returning `THREAD_LOAD_IN_PROGRESS` and did not return a different status even after more than 30 seconds had passed.\nIt occurs **intermittently** on some cold starts, but not every time.\n\nReproduction rate with the MRP: 1 out of 31 attempts.\n\n**Expected behavior:** The asynchronous load will always complete, and `load_threaded_get_status()` will eventually return `THREAD_LOAD_LOADED`.\nReturns `THREAD_LOAD_FAILED` if the load fails.\n\n#### Play environment\n- Pixel 8 Pro (Android 17)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the attached MRP in Godot 4.7.\n2. Export a **debug** APK using the `Android` preset.\n3. Install it on an Android device and launch it.\n4. Tap the **Load** button.\n5. Intermittently, the scene fails to load, and the `Target Scene Loaded` label does not appear; `load_threaded_get_status()` continues to return `THREAD_LOAD_IN_PROGRESS`.\n6. As this is intermittent, if the scene loads in step 5, close the app, restart it, and press the button again.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[threaded-load-hang-pixel8pro-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29837329/threaded-load-hang-pixel8pro-mrp.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121124/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121124/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}